Technology	Used For in WECARE
## Kotlin:
Core programming language used to build the Android application and application logic
## Jetpack:
Compose	Builds the modern UI screens such as Patient Voice, Guardian Dashboard and onboarding
Material 3:
Provides consistent UI components, themes, buttons, cards and accessibility-friendly design
Navigation Compose	Handles navigation between Login → Onboarding → Patient → Guardian → Care screens
## Hilt:
Dependency Injection	Manages and provides app dependencies such as repositories, services and backend components

## StateFlow / SharedFlow:
Manages reactive app state and instantly updates the UI when patient data, alerts or conversations change
## Android Speech API:
APIs	Converts the patient's voice → text for AI processing
Text-to-Speech (TTS)	Converts the AI's response → spoken voice so the patient can interact naturally
